invariant: INV-8
file: handshake.c
catches: webpki_session_test
reason: the retry hello a HelloRetryRequest asked for goes out under
  legacy_record_version 0x0301, which RFC 9846 section 5.1 admits only on
  the initial ClientHello. A retry to secp256r1 may carry no cookie
  (docs/decisions.md 63), so the call position, not the cookie, marks the
  retry hello, and test/webpki_groups_cases.h and
  test/webpki_p256_cases.h read the version with a cookie and without.

--- old
    t->tx[2] = retry ? 0x03 : 0x01;
--- new
    (void)retry;
    t->tx[2] = 0x01;
